UID:591385f276ffa3c34807ae0e@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:October asks you to pause before you push forward. Venus turns
  retrograde on the 3rd in your house of work and routines (6)\, inviting y
 ou to revisit questions of self-worth\, money\, and a key relationship —
  avoid signing\, buying big\, or declaring love until mid-November. Mercur
 y joins the slowdown from the 22nd\, preparing its own retrograde (exact O
 ct 24) in the same house: double-check messages and agreements there. Unde
 rneath\, Jupiter squares your natal Venus (exact Oct 16\, repeating Feb an
 d June) stretching what you value and earn\, while Neptune keeps dissolvin
 g old certainties about your identity in partnership (house 7)\, and Satur
 n quietly tests how you communicate your ideas. On October 6th\, a grand t
 rine lights up your identity and your calling — ease and recognition flo
 w if you use it. The New Moon on the 10th (house 5) plants a seed in creat
 ivity or romance\, reviewed at the Full Moon on the 26th (house 12)\, a mo
 ment for closure and rest. Pluto also turns direct on the 16th\, releasing
  pressure around your beliefs and long-term growth (house 9). → With Ven
 us retrograde reshaping your values and Jupiter pushing your sense of wort
 h\, what deserves a second look before you commit?\n\nYou will find more i
 nformation and detail in the events of October in your calendar. Happy Oct
 ober! ✨\n\n—\n✨ Iris Calendar\n🍎 Updated on 01 Oct 2026\nhttps://
 mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
